(ABSTRACT) Tj
ET
255.1203149606298837 745.5120472440944468 m
340.1596850393700606 745.5120472440944468 l
S
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 700.15771653543311 Td
(With the exponential growth of electronic commerce and Card-Not-Present \(CNP\) digital payment mechanisms, credit) Tj
T* (card fraud has emerged as an acute global financial threat causing multi-billion-dollar annual capital losses.) Tj
T* (Conventional rule-based fraud detection systems exhibit rigid operational thresholds, high false-positive decline rates,) Tj
T* (and an inability to detect evolving non-linear fraud vectors.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 634.3939370078740012 Td
(This project presents CreditGuard AI, an end-to-end machine-learning-based web application designed to evaluate) Tj
T* (transactional, customer demographic, merchant, and geospatial telemetry in real time to detect potentially fraudulent) Tj
T* (transactions. The system incorporates a disciplined data preprocessing pipeline executed on historical transaction) Tj
T* (records \(dataset/train.csv\), wherein non-predictive identifiers and direct card numbers \(cc_num\) are eliminated to) Tj
T* (uphold PCI-DSS privacy standards and prevent model overfitting.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 555.0238582677164914 Td
(Domain-specific feature engineering extracts diurnal and seasonal temporal signals \(hour, day, month, day of week,) Tj
T* (weekend indicator\) from transaction timestamps, calculates cardholder age in fractional years from birth dates, and) Tj
T* (computes the great-circle surface distance between cardholder residence and merchant location using the spherical) Tj
T* (Haversine distance formula. To resolve the curse of dimensionality inherent in high-cardinality financial features) Tj
T* (\(merchant, category, gender, city, state, job\), the pipeline integrates CatBoostEncoder, regularizing category statistics) Tj
T* (against empirical training priors while strictly preventing future target leakage.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 462.0474803149605805 Td
(Acute class imbalance is mitigated through cost-sensitive balanced sample weighting \(compute_sample_weight\),) Tj
T* (penalizing minority fraud classification errors heavily during model training. The core inference estimator utilizes) Tj
T* (Scikit-learnís HistGradientBoostingClassifier \(hyperparameters: learning_rate=0.1, max_iter=150, max_leaf_nodes=31,) Tj
T* (min_samples_leaf=50, l2_regularization=1.0, random_state=42\). A calibrated fraud decision probability threshold of) Tj
T* (0.90 is configured to prioritize high-confidence fraud detection and suppress false alarms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 382.6774015748030706 Td
(The trained pipeline artifacts are serialized via Joblib and deployed within a lightweight Python Flask microservice) Tj
T* (backend paired with a modern, responsive, dark-fintech glassmorphism web interface. The resulting application) Tj
T* (demonstrates an effective prototype for automated financial risk evaluation.) Tj
ET
BT
