BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
56.6929133858267775 711.4962992125983874 Td
(1.1 Background) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 694.4884251968503577 Td
(The 21st century financial ecosystem has witnessed an unprecedented transformation characterized by the rapid) Tj
T* (migration of commerce from brick-and-mortar storefronts to digital, decentralized payment platforms. The proliferation) Tj
T* (of electronic commerce \(e-commerce\), mobile point-of-sale applications, unified payment interfaces, and automated) Tj
T* (clearing houses has made cashless transactions ubiquitous. Millions of consumers worldwide conduct debit and credit) Tj
T* (card operations every second, transferring trillions of dollars across international banking rails.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 616.5356692913385359 Td
(However, this exponential acceleration of digital transaction velocity has introduced acute systemic vulnerabilities. The) Tj
T* (detachment of the physical payment card from the checkout processótermed Card-Not-Present \(CNP\)) Tj
T* (transactionsóhas created fertile ground for illicit syndicates, unauthorized credential abuse, identity theft, and) Tj
T* (automated carding attacks. Fraudulent transactions not only impose devastating multi-billion-dollar direct capital losses) Tj
T* (on retail banks, merchants, and cardholders, but they also degrade consumer trust in digital banking infrastructure,) Tj
T* (escalate dispute-handling overheads, and incur severe regulatory penalties.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 524.9766141732283131 Td
(In this high-stakes threat landscape, the implementation of robust, real-time fraud detection systems has evolved from) Tj
T* (an operational option into a mandatory foundational pillar of electronic banking. As fraud patterns shift dynamically to) Tj
T* (bypass static operational rules, the application of modern Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Machine Learning \(ML\)) Tj
T* (techniques has emerged as the premier technological frontier for financial defense, enabling the automated discovery of) Tj
T* (subtle, multivariate anomalies buried deep within massive volumes of legitimate transaction streams.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
56.6929133858267775 441.3545669291337958 Td
(1.2 Problem Statement) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 424.3466929133857093 Td
(For decades, financial institutions predominantly defended payment networks using deterministic, heuristic-driven rule) Tj
T* (engines. These legacy systems rely on human-authored threshold policiesósuch as automatically flagging any single) Tj
T* (transaction exceeding $5,000, rejecting purchases occurring outside a cardholderís domestic billing state, or declining) Tj
T* (more than three rapid successive transactions within ten minutes.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 360.0002362204724022 Td
(While conceptually simple to implement, traditional rule-based fraud detection mechanisms suffer from severe,) Tj
T* (structural limitations in modern high-velocity financial environments:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 322.8663779527558972 Td
(1. Inflexibility and High False Positive Rates: Hardcoded thresholds fail to capture the complex, non-linear context of) Tj
T* (legitimate modern consumer behavior. Legitimate high-value holiday purchases or travel expenditures are frequently) Tj
T* (declined, creating extreme customer friction and cart abandonment.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 272.1262204724408775 Td
(2. Inability to Detect Novel Attack Vectors: Sophisticated financial criminals actively probe and identify static rule) Tj
T* (thresholds, intentionally calibrating fraudulent transaction amounts \(e.g., executing unauthorized charges of $49.90) Tj
T* (rather than $50.00\) to remain beneath trigger thresholds.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 221.3860629921258578 Td
(3. Dimensionality and Scalability Bottlenecks: Human fraud analysts cannot manually synthesize multi-dimensional) Tj
T* (correlations spanning transaction frequency, geographical displacement, merchant categories, temporal cycles, and) Tj
T* (cardholder age simultaneously across millions of concurrent streaming events.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 170.6459055118109518 Td
(Consequently, there is an urgent requirement for an intelligent, adaptive, machine-learning-based fraud detection system) Tj
T* (capable of learning high-dimensional non-linear interactions directly from historical transactional data, computing) Tj
T* (calibrated fraud risk probabilities, and operating with high precision to minimize costly false alarms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.471 g
56.6929133858267775 807.8742519685039269 Td
(CreditGuard AI: AI-Powered Credit Card Fraud Detection System ï BCA Project Report) Tj
