56.6929133858267775 785.1970866141732586 Td
(1.3 Motivation) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 768.1892125984252289 Td
(The core motivation behind developing CreditGuard AI stems from the critical need to bridge the gap between) Tj
T* (theoretical machine learning methodologies and deployable, practical financial technology applications. While) Tj
T* (numerous academic studies explore isolated algorithmic benchmarks on static data, real-world fraud mitigation requires) Tj
T* (an end-to-end, resilient pipeline capable of ingesting raw transaction telemetry, executing automated feature) Tj
T* (engineering, handling extreme class imbalance, evaluating high-precision probability thresholds, and rendering instant) Tj
T* (risk interpretations via an intuitive web interface.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 676.6301574803148924 Td
(Furthermore, modern financial compliance and risk management protocols demand that risk evaluation systems do not) Tj
T* (act as obscure "black boxes." Risk analysts and investigators require clear, continuous probability metrics and structured) Tj
T* (risk indicators that distinguish routine low-risk activities from critical anomalies. CreditGuard AI was conceived as an) Tj
T* (end-to-end undergraduate computer applications engineering project that demonstrates how modern Python machine) Tj
T* (learning libraries \(such as Scikit-learn, Category Encoders, and Joblib\) can be harmoniously integrated with lightweight) Tj
T* (microservice architectures \(Flask\) to produce an accessible, production-styled decision support system.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
56.6929133858267775 579.4018110236220309 Td
(1.4 Objectives) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 562.3939370078740012 Td
(The overarching aim of this project is to research, design, develop, and evaluate an automated machine-learning-based) Tj
T* (credit card fraud detection system. To accomplish this aim, the specific technical objectives are formulated as follows:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 525.2600787401574962 Td
(1. Transaction Data Ingestion and Cleansing: Ingest raw transaction datasets, eliminate redundant record identifiers, and) Tj
T* (enforce strict data hygiene to avoid data leakage.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 488.1262204724409344 Td
(2. Domain-Specific Feature Engineering: Formulate temporal, demographic, and geospatial features from raw) Tj
T* (transaction timestamps, customer birth dates, and geographical coordinates using the Haversine spherical distance) Tj
T* (formula.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 437.3860629921259715 Td
(3. Target-Aware Categorical Feature Encoding: Implement and validate CatBoost Encoding to transform) Tj
T* (high-cardinality categorical variables \(such as merchant names, job titles, and cities\) into continuous mathematical) Tj
T* (representations without inducing dimensional explosion.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 386.6459055118109518 Td
(4. Class Imbalance Mitigation: Implement cost-sensitive balanced sample weighting during algorithm training to) Tj
T* (counter the acute rarity of fraudulent samples relative to legitimate transactions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 349.5120472440944468 Td
(5. Model Construction and Optimization: Train and tune a high-performance Scikit-learn) Tj
T* (HistGradientBoostingClassifier utilizing histogram-based continuous feature binning and L2 regularization.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 312.3781889763779418 Td
(6. Calibrated Probability Thresholding: Establish and evaluate a strict fraud decision probability threshold of 0.90 to) Tj
T* (prioritize high-confidence fraud detection and suppress false alarms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 275.2443307086614368 Td
(7. Serialization and Pipeline Packaging: Safely serialize all fitted data transformation encoders, model weights, and) Tj
T* (decision thresholds into reusable Joblib artifacts for persistent deployment.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 238.1104724409449318 Td
(8. Web Application Development: Construct a modern, responsive, dark-mode fintech web application using Flask,) Tj
T* (HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, providing instant risk telemetry, probability visualizations, and transaction reset) Tj
T* (capabilities.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
