(The scope is defined as an academic simulation and decision-support prototype. It does not encompass live integration) Tj
T* (into core banking switches \(such as ISO 8583 message networks\), hardware cryptographic security modules \(HSM\), or) Tj
T* (distributed streaming infrastructure \(e.g., Apache Kafka\), which are treated as future scope items.) Tj
