(1.6 Significance of the Project) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 600.3781889763779418 Td
(The significance of CreditGuard AI lies in its demonstration of applied data science and software engineering principles) Tj
T* (within the financial security domain. For an undergraduate Bachelor of Computer Applications curriculum, the project) Tj
T* (synthesizes foundational disciplinesóincluding object-oriented programming, data structures, applied statistics, web) Tj
T* (development, and software testingóinto a coherent, industry-relevant application.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 536.0317322834645211 Td
(From a functional perspective, the system illustrates how disciplined feature engineering \(such as calculating the) Tj
T* (physical distance between cardholder residence and merchant location\) can drastically elevate predictive signal in) Tj
T* (complex financial datasets. Moreover, by explicitly addressing the real-world operational trade-offs of false positives) Tj
T* (through a calibrated 0.90 probability threshold, the project emphasizes pragmatic engineering over theoretical idealism.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
56.6929133858267775 466.0159842519684616 Td
(1.7 Limitations) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 449.0081102362204319 Td
(In alignment with rigorous academic transparency, several inherent project limitations must be acknowledged:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 425.4805511811022711 Td
(ï Dataset Boundary: The machine learning pipeline is fitted on a curated historical dataset \(train.csv\). The distribution of) Tj
T* (fraud tactics reflects the time window and demographic parameters of this data and may not encompass emerging) Tj
T* (synthetic identity schemes or zero-day fraud mechanisms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 374.7403937007873083 Td
(ï Single-Node Architecture: The Flask backend operates as a single-process development web server suitable for) Tj
T* (academic demonstration rather than a horizontally scaled, containerized cluster.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 337.6065354330708033 Td
(ï Absence of Live Core Banking Rails: The system relies on manual or API-simulated transaction submissions rather) Tj
T* (than intercepting live credit card authorization messages from Visa, Mastercard, or RuPay processing networks.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 300.4726771653542983 Td
(ï Threshold Rigidity: The 0.90 fraud decision threshold is a static, project-configured hyperparameter. In commercial) Tj
T* (banking environments, thresholds are dynamic, adjusting per customer risk tier, transaction volume, and temporal) Tj
T* (volatility.) Tj
ET
