BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
56.6929133858267775 711.4962992125983874 Td
(2.1 Credit Card Fraud Detection) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 694.4884251968503577 Td
(The discipline of credit card fraud detection has evolved continuously alongside changes in global consumer payment) Tj
T* (mechanisms. In early payment history, fraud was restricted to physical card counterfeiting, card skimming at ATMs, and) Tj
T* (stolen card use. The introduction of magnetic stripes and subsequently EMV \(Europay, Mastercard, Visa\) integrated) Tj
T* (chip-and-PIN standards drastically minimized physical point-of-sale counterfeiting. [Reference to be Added]) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 630.1419685039369369 Td
(Consequently, criminal activity shifted decisively toward Card-Not-Present \(CNP\) channels. In CNP transactions,) Tj
T* (including online e-commerce checkouts and telephone orders, the merchant never inspects the physical card, relying) Tj
T* (solely on card credentials \(card number, expiration date, CVV, and billing address\). This shift has caused fraud detection) Tj
T* (to transition from a physical authentication challenge to a complex data-mining and anomaly-detection challenge across) Tj
T* (continuous transaction streams. [Reference to be Added]) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
56.6929133858267775 546.5199212598424765 Td
(2.2 Traditional Fraud Detection Approaches) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 529.5120472440944468 Td
(Initial industrial attempts to automate fraud detection centered on expert rule-based engines. In these architectures,) Tj
T* (senior risk investigators author deterministic logic statements based on historical fraud post-mortems. Representative) Tj
T* (rules include blocking transactions where the purchase amount is greater than a fixed monetary threshold, or declining) Tj
T* (transactions where the billing zip code does not match the cardholder registration records. [Reference to be Added]) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 465.1655905511810261 Td
(While computationally lightweight and fully interpretable, deterministic systems exhibit chronic vulnerabilities:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
