56.6929133858267775 404.5041732283463602 Td
(ï High Maintenance and Rule Explosion: Over time, financial institutions accumulate thousands of overlapping,) Tj
T* (contradictory rules. This results in software maintenance overhead, unintended transaction declines, and immense) Tj
T* (operational fragility. [Reference to be Added]) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 353.7640157480313974 Td
(ï Inability to Recognize Non-Linear Combinations: A transaction with an ordinary amount \($25\) at an ordinary) Tj
T* (merchant category \(Groceries\) may appear harmless under isolated rules, yet when combined with an abnormal 3:00) Tj
T* (AM timestamp and a 1,200-kilometer displacement from the cardholder home, it represents extreme risk. Static rules) Tj
T* (struggle with such combinatorial subtleties.) Tj
ET
