0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 266.7403937007873083 Td
(To overcome the rigidity of rule engines, academic researchers and financial technology pioneers turned toward) Tj
T* (Machine Learning \(ML\). Unlike deterministic systems, ML algorithms do not rely on static logic; rather, they consume) Tj
T* (large volumes of historical transaction records to discover statistical correlations, non-linear relationships, and) Tj
T* (behavioral anomalies autonomously. [Reference to be Added]) Tj
ET
BT
