(In literature, machine learning fraud detection encompasses three dominant paradigms:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 178.8663779527557836 Td
(1. Supervised Learning: Algorithms are trained on historical records where each transaction is explicitly labeled as) Tj
T* (legitimate or fraudulent. The model learns a decision boundary mapping input features to binary classification targets.) Tj
ET
