/F5 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.118 g
68.031496062992133 523.2758267716535556 Td
(Final Prediction = "Potentially Fraudulent" if P\(is_fraud = 1\) >= 0.90 else "Legitimate") Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 496.3466929133857661 Td
(Academic Clarification: It is essential to emphasize that the 0.90 threshold is a project-specific architectural) Tj
