T* (unconditionally predicts 0 \(Legitimate\) for every single transaction will achieve a mathematically impressive 99.8%) Tj
T* (accuracy. However, its operational utility is zero, as 100% of fraudulent attacks succeed undetected.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 425.4805511811023848 Td
